{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cefbee02-99e1-8ea2-9156-574b8f9018e8",
  "created_at": "2026-01-15T10:52:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Erin Doyle",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:45:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:45:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, sorry, I know this is silly, but I'm calling about a catch basin. Is this the right department for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:45:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is. Which basin, and where is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:45:45-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, so it's on the corner by my house. I'm at 122 Memorial Boulevard, the Easton's Beach side. The grate at the corner is just packed with leaves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:46:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 122 Memorial. And how long has it been packed up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:46:06-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, um, since before the holidays. Honestly, I think since early December. And it's not even raining. It's been dry for days, and there's still this big puddle sitting there that never drains."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:46:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the water's just sitting there with no storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:46:29-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. I know this is silly, because it's not a flood or anything. But the puddle just stays. And the sidewalk is a sheet of mud and grit. All the leaf gunk and sand washes down and dries on it. I almost went down yesterday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:46:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's not silly, that's exactly what we want to hear about. Is the puddle in the street or over the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:47:05-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, it's mostly in the gutter, but it spreads out across the corner. You have to walk through it or go around into the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:47:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Let me pull up the basin records. Hang on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:47:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, no rush. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:47:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm looking. What I'm seeing is that basin on the corner there, and I'm not seeing a cleaning logged very recently. Let me scroll back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:47:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, can I ask when they last came by? Because I feel like nobody's been out since the fall, at least."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:47:55-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The last entry I can see is from the autumn, before the leaves really came down. So it makes sense that it filled up after that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:48:09-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, it's just kind of annoying, because I walk past it every day. I figured somebody would notice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:48:20-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly, in leaf season the crews go by the main routes first and the side corners can get missed. I'll put in a work order for a cleaning at that corner. Can you tell me the cross street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:48:40-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, sorry, it's the corner right by my place, down by the beach end. I'd say just put 122 Memorial Boulevard and the corner next to it. It's the grate on the beach side of the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:49:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Is there anything else in the grate besides leaves, like trash or a branch?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:49:09-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, mostly leaves and sand, and some sticks. I can't see down into it. There's a plastic bag on top too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:49:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Leaves, sand, sticks, a bag. Do you want a callback when it's done, or just leave it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:49:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, a callback would be nice. It's 401-555-0161."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:49:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one six one, got it. Is this a landline? I'll leave a message if you're out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:49:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the house phone. Sorry, my husband is always saying nobody answers it, but a message is fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:49:56-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Now, in the meantime, please don't try to clear the grate yourself if you can't see in. Just stay on the sidewalk side of any standing water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:50:12-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no, I wasn't going to. Sorry, I did kick some of the mud off the walk with a broom, but it just comes right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:50:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it will until the basin's draining. Once it's cleaned out, the runoff won't keep carrying the grit over there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:50:37-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, I know you must be busy, but is there any idea of when? Like this week, or next month?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:50:49-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd say you're looking at somewhere in the next week or two. Cold weather and frozen ground can slow things down, but a clogged basin with standing water goes up the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:51:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fine. Sorry, I really don't want to be a pest about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:51:14-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're not. If it's still sitting there in two weeks, call back and mention the work order, and I'll chase it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:51:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, will I get a number or something to reference?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:51:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. I'll have it in a second. Hold on while it generates."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:51:39-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Sorry, I've got a golf tournament replay on in the other room with the sound off, so I'm not distracted. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:51:52-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Alright, it's in. I'll give you the reference as the work order for the Memorial Boulevard catch basin, logged today, Thursday the fifteenth. If you say that, anyone can find it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:52:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Memorial Boulevard catch basin, today's date. Sorry, got it. I wrote it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:52:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Anything else I can help with this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:52:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, sorry, that's it. Thank you for taking it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:52:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for calling, Erin. Have a good rest of your day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T10:52:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye."
    }
  ],
